1
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
(Blossom Through the Cloud)

2
00:01:35,001 --> 00:01:37,960
(Adapted from the novel on JJWXC, "Landing on My Heart", by Qiao Yao)

3
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:11,200
If he's the right person,

4
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,560
his waiting...

5
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,560
will surely turn into your growing courage.

6
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:18,600
I like you.

7
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,440
If your heart flutters too,

8
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:22,840
then we can...

9
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:27,600
I don't know why,

10
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:30,000
but these eyes of yours...

11
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:32,000
make my anxiety and frustration...

12
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,680
vanish in an instant.

13
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:36,320
Whether it's because of my personality...

14
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:38,600
or because of my family background,

15
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,560
in the past,

16
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:42,400
I always ran away from your feelings.

17
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:44,320
But now,

18
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:45,960
should I...

19
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:47,600
bravely...

20
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,240
hold on to this love?

21
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:58,040
(Episode 14: You Can Be My Boyfriend)

22
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,600
She has been standing there for ages.

23
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,160
Even if she turns into a statue,

24
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:39,920
it won't help.

25
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,400
You're definitely related.

26
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:53,840
I knew you would come!

27
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:56,560
You chose such a great location.

28
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,856
A quiet oasis in the middle of the city.

29
00:03:57,880 --> 00:04:02,040
Right? In my studio, there's a huge glass window.

30
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:04,520
This is the soul of my studio.

31
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:29,440
What's wrong?

32
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,200
Nothing.

33
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,840
Xuan, I'm not feeling well. I'll head out first.

34
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:36,880
Ruan...

35
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,040
Let's take a look.

36
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:41,000
This place really matches...

37
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:42,640
your photography style.

38
00:04:42,641 --> 00:04:44,000
Mr. Guo, please go in first.

39
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:46,320
- Go in and take a look. - Go ahead. Do your own thing.

40
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:52,840
Ms. Ruan!

41
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:56,560
Ms. Ruan, are you leaving already?

42
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:58,640
I'm sorry. I'm not feeling well.

43
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:00,720
Then go home and get some rest.

44
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,280
I wanted to give you this.

45
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,720
A gift.

46
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:08,439
- Thank you. - I should be the one thanking you.

47
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:10,400
You gave me such a generous red packet.

48
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,480
Remember to hire me if you have work.

49
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:13,880
Sure.

50
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,056
Go on and get back to it. I'll get going now.

51
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:17,160
Go home and rest well.

52
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,040
Bye, Ms. Ruan.

53
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,720
Here's a red one for you.

54
00:05:48,520 --> 00:05:49,520
Try it.

55
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:58,760
Sour?

56
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:00,200
It's sour.

57
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:02,400
I didn't realize...

58
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,280
you were so domestic.

59
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,279
What other surprises...

60
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:08,280
do you have for me?

61
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,480
Anything else would be...

62
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:11,280
a premium service.

63
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:15,760
You're choking.

64
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,680
Here, have some water.

65
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,560
Slow down.

66
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,000
Come with me somewhere tomorrow.

67
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,480
- Where? - Archery.

68
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,360
It's Zhu Dong's birthday.

69
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:49,320
I'm not going.

70
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,600
Sourpuss.

71
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,000
I'm not eating it.

72
00:06:56,480 --> 00:07:01,880
(Jiangcheng Fishing Boat 60868)

73
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:04,400
Hi. Happy birthday!

74
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,120
Thank you.

75
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:08,880
This venue is really nice.

76
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:10,800
How about I give you a tour?

77
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:12,320
How about I teach you?

78
00:07:12,321 --> 00:07:13,640
- One-on-one. - Sure.

79
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:16,200
Don't you have anything better to do?

80
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,760
Put the cake in the fridge.

81
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,320
Is the equipment ready?

82
00:07:21,640 --> 00:07:22,640
Of course...

83
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,040
Not yet.

84
00:07:24,041 --> 00:07:25,320
How about I help you tune it?

85
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:26,880
Well, obviously.

86
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:28,760
Okay.

87
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:31,399
Here. Put this in the fridge.

88
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:32,480
That's just how he is.

89
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,560
Enthusiastic.

90
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,479
Where's Yan An? Why isn't he here yet?

91
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:38,119
He said he went to pick up You An.

92
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,216
He'll probably be a bit late.

93
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,560
Is Zheng You An coming today too?

94
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:43,136
Yeah. Didn't we talk about it in the group chat yesterday?

95
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,160
Didn't you see?

96
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:45,960
Right, you never check it.

97
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:50,000
Hurry, my arms are about to break!

98
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,160
Don't drop it!

99
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,360
- Dong Zi, help me with this! - Ms. Ruan?

100
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,199
Ms. Ruan.

101
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:58,599
Have you been abroad for too long?

102
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,680
Why are you always so late?

103
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:02,040
I brought some freshly made and delicious food.

104
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,199
- What did you bring? - Come on.

105
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,879
Everyone's here. Let's get started.

106
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:06,880
Let's begin.

107
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:25,840
There's no name on it.

108
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:26,960
Hold on.

109
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:31,600
Wait, Dong Zi. Didn't they already tie it for you?

110
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,399
- Well... - I'll get you guys some water.

111
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,720
It's not right. It's all...

112
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,799
It came off.

113
00:08:36,800 --> 00:08:37,800
- It's too loose. - Fine.

114
00:08:37,801 --> 00:08:38,840
Come here, my lady.

115
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:40,320
Tell me if it's too tight.

116
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,639
Got it. This one.

117
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,079
Now I'm going to teach you properly.

118
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,080
Are you crazy?

119
00:08:46,081 --> 00:08:47,199
Stand sideways.

120
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,519
Keep your feet slightly apart.

121
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:49,520
Shoulder-width apart.

122
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:52,080
Remember, keep your body in a straight line.

123
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,216
Hold the bow with your left hand.

124
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,640
Grip the riser with your left hand.

125
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,280
The arrow goes into the rest here.

126
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:06,400
The grip is at the bottom,

127
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:07,960
and the sight is at the top.

128
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,616
The white feather is the index feather.

129
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,640
It should be facing you.

130
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,480
The nock goes right here.

131
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,360
Pull it back.

132
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,440
A little further.

133
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,519
Pull it straight. Keep it against your chin.

134
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:23,360
Release. Just like that.

135
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,280
Your index finger...

136
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,520
should rest against your jaw.

137
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,000
Your thumb...

138
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,160
should be against your neck.

139
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,400
Pull it to this position.

140
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:36,400
Let's give it a try.

141
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:37,800
First, pull it back slowly.

142
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,296
This feather with the unique color...

143
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,440
should face to the left.

144
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:46,560
Then you keep the arrow straight like this.

145
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:50,520
Steady now.

146
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:51,920
Don't be so stiff.

147
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:53,640
Tighten your core.

148
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,720
Missed the target.

149
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,000
No.

150
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:09,240
It just slipped from my hand.

151
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:10,480
Let me demonstrate for you.

152
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:14,840
Adjust your breathing.

153
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,919
Push with your left hand, and pull with your right.

154
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:18,160
Tighten your core.

155
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:19,760
- Your core. - Right.

156
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,640
Here.

157
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:30,600
Adjust your breathing.

158
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,016
You really know how to do this.

159
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:37,160
I believe you can do it too.

160
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:38,640
Try one more time.

161
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:40,240
"You really know how to do this."

162
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:41,520
You take the shot.

163
00:10:41,521 --> 00:10:42,601
I've finished teaching you.

164
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,519
Wait, what did you even teach me?

165
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:45,920
Didn't I just teach you?

166
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:48,320
- I... - Okay, you two pairs of lovebirds.

167
00:10:48,760 --> 00:10:49,960
Let's start the competition.

168
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,840
We'll have five rounds in total.

169
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,799
In each round, the one with the higher score...

170
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:54,800
gets two points.

171
00:10:54,801 --> 00:10:56,176
If it's a tie, each person gets one point.

172
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,376
The one with the lower score gets no points.

173
00:10:57,400 --> 00:10:59,200
Men get three arrows per round.

174
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,640
Women get four arrows per round.

175
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,000
Why?

176
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:03,960
What do you mean, why?

177
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,400
Why do we get an extra arrow?

178
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:06,800
Aren't you guys beginners?

179
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:08,760
A competition should follow the rules.

180
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,360
Otherwise, even if I win,

181
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:11,840
it won't feel satisfying.

182
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:14,560
How could you possibly win, Zheng You An?

183
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:15,960
Don't interfere.

184
00:11:15,961 --> 00:11:18,200
How about we all use three arrows?

185
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:20,520
Fine.

186
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:21,560
Let's start then.

187
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:00,800
- I'm not playing anymore. - Why are you getting upset?

188
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,320
I'm here to take photos.

189
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:14,720
I missed.

190
00:12:30,680 --> 00:12:32,000
Fu Ming Yu, you're being no fun.

191
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:35,160
My last arrow just wanted to land there.

192
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,400
Good shot.

193
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:40,960
Sick shot. So sick.

194
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:42,240
Sick shot!

195
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:44,240
That really was a sick shot.

196
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,840
Very sick.

197
00:12:48,400 --> 00:12:49,400
Just get ready to eat.

198
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:53,160
- You really don't need help? - Here comes the last dish!

199
00:12:54,280 --> 00:12:56,840
This one is specifically for you, Ms. Ruan.

200
00:12:57,520 --> 00:12:58,520
Braised pig's trotter.

201
00:12:58,760 --> 00:12:59,760
Eat your fill.

202
00:12:59,761 --> 00:13:01,321
What are you laughing at? It's for you.

203
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,720
It's for me.

204
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,480
Since all the dishes are served,

205
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,200
let's cut the cake.

206
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:07,640
Make a wish.

207
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:09,080
- Hurry. - I'll light the candles.

208
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:12,920
Come on.

209
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:18,320
Happy birthday to you

210
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:22,320
Happy birthday to you

211
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:26,640
Happy birthday to you

212
00:13:27,040 --> 00:13:30,760
Happy birthday to you

213
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,080
Make a wish.

214
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:35,840
Make a wish, birthday boy.

215
00:13:36,920 --> 00:13:37,920
Then I hope...

216
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,000
that in the days to come,

217
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:41,600
there will be plenty of happiness like today.

218
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:45,080
Nice. Happy birthday!

219
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:47,600
- Happy birthday! - Thank you.

220
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:50,520
15, 20, 15!

221
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:52,440
Drink up!

222
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:53,520
Zheng You An, drink up!

223
00:13:54,400 --> 00:13:55,679
The first round doesn't count.

224
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:56,999
- Again! - Fine!

225
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,640
- 15, 20, 15! - 15, 20, 20!

226
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:00,399
- The second round doesn't count! - Yan An, drink!

227
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:01,479
- The second round doesn't count. - Drink! Yan An, drink!

228
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:03,279
- The second round doesn't count! - Ms. Ruan!

229
00:14:03,280 --> 00:14:04,359
- Come on. - Thank you.

230
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,799
A loss is a loss.

231
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:07,360
- How can you be like this? - For what?

232
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:10,680
I'm having a great time tonight.

233
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:12,160
Careful.

234
00:14:12,161 --> 00:14:13,640
Zheng You An, are you serious?

235
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:15,160
Who was it that said...

236
00:14:15,280 --> 00:14:16,560
I'm a sore loser?

237
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:19,680
- It was you, wasn't it? - You must be even happier than me.

238
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:28,960
It's getting late.

239
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:30,256
I have to head back to the office.

240
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:31,280
I'll head out first.

241
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,360
Happy birthday.
Thank you.

242
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:35,080
What are you doing? Bottoms up!

243
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:37,280
Ruan Ruan, let's head back.

244
00:14:38,880 --> 00:14:40,280
I'm heading to the office now. Bye.

245
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:41,999
- We're leaving then. - Bye.

246
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,000
- Bye. - Bye.

247
00:15:27,680 --> 00:15:28,759
My skewers are cold.

248
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:29,920
Heat them up for me.

249
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,679
- Bring them here. - And my chicken wings.

250
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,800
- Did you grill them for me? - I'm grilling them now.

251
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:35,480
Careful.

252
00:15:35,481 --> 00:15:36,519
- It's raining! - What's going on?

253
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:38,039
- Let's go! - My skewers!

254
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,079
Go! Don't...

255
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,439
- Go inside! Don't get wet! - No, my...

256
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,440
Hurry back inside!

257
00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:44,800
It's raining!

258
00:15:49,880 --> 00:15:50,880
So sudden.

259
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,000
(Mom)

260
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:41,440
Hello?

261
00:17:41,760 --> 00:17:42,760
Ming Yu,

262
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,080
Goldie is sick.

263
00:17:45,760 --> 00:17:46,760
Sick?

264
00:17:47,800 --> 00:17:49,080
You should come back right away.

265
00:17:53,560 --> 00:17:54,560
I understand.

266
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,320
I have to go to the office first.

267
00:17:58,440 --> 00:17:59,440
I'll be back a bit later.

268
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:01,680
Okay, I'm hanging up now.

269
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:11,200
You're awake.

270
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:18,440
You can just drop me off here.

271
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:42,600
You're still coming up?

272
00:18:43,520 --> 00:18:44,520
I live here too.

273
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:46,360
Why can't I go up?

274
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:49,800
Don't you have work at the office?

275
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:51,256
And don't you have someone at home...

276
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:52,280
Someone...

277
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,200
Were you faking sleep?

278
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:02,720
W... What?

279
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:05,200
Are you acting all righteous after secretly kissing me?

280
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:10,399
When I kissed you,

281
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,400
you didn't react.

282
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:15,360
You kept pretending to be asleep.

283
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:17,240
Doesn't that mean you didn't mind?

284
00:19:27,720 --> 00:19:28,880
If you don't move away,

285
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:32,280
I'm going to kiss you again.

286
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:01,480
That's how love is.

287
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:04,160
After weathering many storms,

288
00:20:05,160 --> 00:20:06,200
it suddenly arrives.

289
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:37,520
You're my girlfriend now, right?

290
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:46,960
Here. Is it secured yet?

291
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:49,080
It's done.

292
00:20:49,600 --> 00:20:50,600
Okay, let go.

293
00:20:51,840 --> 00:20:52,840
Careful.

294
00:20:55,120 --> 00:20:56,280
Help me see if it's straight.

295
00:20:58,120 --> 00:20:59,560
Ms. Zheng, are you busy?

296
00:21:00,360 --> 00:21:01,360
Mom.

297
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:04,880
Why didn't you tell me that you were coming?

298
00:21:05,080 --> 00:21:06,439
You haven't been home for days.

299
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,600
Can't I come and see you?

300
00:21:08,240 --> 00:21:10,240
I bought you your favorite cake.

301
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:12,160
Mom, you know me best.

302
00:21:12,360 --> 00:21:13,880
How is it? You must be exhausted.

303
00:21:15,360 --> 00:21:16,360
Not bad.

304
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:17,800
It has only been a few days,

305
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:19,320
and you've got it all set up.

306
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:20,600
My daughter is so capable.

307
00:21:20,720 --> 00:21:21,720
Of course.

308
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:23,440
Lately,

309
00:21:23,520 --> 00:21:25,160
I haven't just been busy with the studio.

310
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:27,080
I've also been playing matchmaker.

311
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:29,880
What? Are you turning this into a dating agency?

312
00:21:30,040 --> 00:21:31,040
No.

313
00:21:31,840 --> 00:21:32,880
Mom, look.

314
00:21:33,960 --> 00:21:34,960
My masterpiece.

315
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:36,960
Fu Ming Yu?

316
00:21:37,320 --> 00:21:38,320
He's quite handsome.

317
00:21:38,360 --> 00:21:39,480
Is he the focus?

318
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:42,200
It's the person in front. This partial side profile.

319
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:46,280
That's the female pilot from his airline.

320
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:48,119
She came to my opening.

321
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:49,120
Do you remember her?

322
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:53,240
On the day of the opening,

323
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:55,160
I gave this photo...

324
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:56,920
to Ms. Ruan.

325
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:59,000
And the result?

326
00:22:00,800 --> 00:22:02,360
The two of them got together.

327
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,760
Don't you think I've got a gift?

328
00:22:06,840 --> 00:22:07,920
Are you saying those two...

329
00:22:08,120 --> 00:22:09,120
got together?

330
00:22:09,760 --> 00:22:10,760
Are you sure?

331
00:22:10,761 --> 00:22:11,920
Absolutely sure.

332
00:22:12,120 --> 00:22:13,880
At Zhu Dong's birthday party a few days ago,

333
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:15,520
Fu Ming Yu brought her along with him.

334
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:17,280
They were even holding hands.

335
00:22:18,560 --> 00:22:20,000
I don't blame you for being shocked.

336
00:22:20,320 --> 00:22:22,680
When I was drinking with Ms. Ruan before,

337
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:24,720
my dislike for Fu Ming Yu...

338
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:26,400
was about a 7 out of 10.

339
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:27,880
But then,

340
00:22:27,881 --> 00:22:29,560
every single complaint Ms. Ruan made...

341
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:30,936
was even more spot-on than mine.

342
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:33,320
If they didn't have a history, who could be that vicious?

343
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:34,920
And then?

344
00:22:35,640 --> 00:22:37,640
Well, it only took one photo of mine...

345
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:39,079
to make the two of them...

346
00:22:39,080 --> 00:22:40,440
bury the hatchet.

347
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:41,680
All right.

348
00:22:41,800 --> 00:22:43,480
I can handle this juicy gossip.

349
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:46,600
But you had better think about...

350
00:22:46,720 --> 00:22:47,880
how to deal with your father.

351
00:22:48,800 --> 00:22:50,600
Now that Fu Ming Yu is in love with someone,

352
00:22:51,040 --> 00:22:53,200
the most heartbroken person will probably be your dad.

353
00:22:54,280 --> 00:22:55,560
My dad is old enough.

354
00:22:56,160 --> 00:22:58,080
He'll have his own way of processing it.

355
00:22:58,600 --> 00:22:59,759
Mom, get up. Come on. Don't just sit here chatting.

356
00:22:59,760 --> 00:23:00,760
Have some cake.

357
00:23:00,761 --> 00:23:02,319
I'll eat in a bit. Look.

358
00:23:02,320 --> 00:23:03,799
The soul of my studio...

359
00:23:03,800 --> 00:23:05,600
lies in this large glass window...

360
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:06,640
behind me.

361
00:23:08,160 --> 00:23:09,160
I just finished setting up the lights.

362
00:23:09,161 --> 00:23:10,279
Mom, stand here. I'll take some photos of you.

363
00:23:10,280 --> 00:23:11,439
- Let's go. - Okay.

364
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:13,536
Then you had better make them look better than last time.

365
00:23:13,560 --> 00:23:14,560
I will.

366
00:23:14,561 --> 00:23:15,680
This window is really nice.

367
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:25,976
This is your flight schedule for the coming period.

368
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:27,000
I haven't even entered the briefing room,

369
00:23:27,001 --> 00:23:28,401
and I can barely keep my eyes open.

370
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:34,480
Let me know when it's over.

371
00:23:52,200 --> 00:23:53,360
I have something to tell you.

372
00:23:53,640 --> 00:23:54,640
Answer the phone.

373
00:23:54,641 --> 00:23:57,520
(Dong Xian)

374
00:24:01,120 --> 00:24:02,120
What is it?

375
00:24:02,760 --> 00:24:03,760
I heard...

376
00:24:04,080 --> 00:24:05,360
you and Ming Yu are together.

377
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:07,280
Did Zheng You An tell you?

378
00:24:07,600 --> 00:24:09,480
Yes, An An told me today.

379
00:24:09,800 --> 00:24:11,800
But I remember Ming Yu told me last time...

380
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:13,760
that you two were just colleagues.

381
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:16,520
At most, you were friends.

382
00:24:17,040 --> 00:24:18,040
Right?

383
00:24:18,240 --> 00:24:19,240
Is something wrong?

384
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:21,959
It's nothing.

385
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:23,719
I was thinking we should find some time...

386
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,016
to sit down and have a good talk.

387
00:24:25,040 --> 00:24:27,000
I would also like to tell you more about Ming Yu.

388
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:29,280
After all, I know him quite well.

389
00:24:29,600 --> 00:24:31,040
I watched him grow up.

390
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:33,200
You've watched so many people grow up,

391
00:24:33,680 --> 00:24:34,960
but you didn't watch me grow up.

392
00:24:36,320 --> 00:24:37,320
First of all,

393
00:24:37,520 --> 00:24:38,640
you don't know me very well.

394
00:24:39,280 --> 00:24:40,280
Secondly,

395
00:24:40,400 --> 00:24:41,680
I don't need to learn about...

396
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:43,720
my own boyfriend from someone else.

397
00:24:44,280 --> 00:24:46,280
Ruan Ruan, I think you've misunderstood me.

398
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:48,640
Ruan Ruan...

399
00:25:08,200 --> 00:25:09,280
I was in the parking lot...

400
00:25:09,520 --> 00:25:10,680
and overheard a conversation.

401
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:17,960
That person sounded like my girlfriend.

402
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:21,440
You could tell it was me from my back?

403
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:23,000
Wait here.

404
00:25:23,080 --> 00:25:24,240
I'll go buy you some oranges.

405
00:25:32,280 --> 00:25:34,280
You finally admitted that I'm your boyfriend.

406
00:25:41,000 --> 00:25:42,000
Let's go, girlfriend.

407
00:25:48,360 --> 00:25:49,560
I'm taking my girlfriend home.

408
00:26:07,840 --> 00:26:08,840
Let's go.

409
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:42,760
Gosh, the elevator again?

410
00:26:44,360 --> 00:26:45,520
Quick, distract yourself.

411
00:26:45,840 --> 00:26:46,920
Right, find a topic.

412
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:48,440
Quick, find a topic.

413
00:26:48,840 --> 00:26:49,840
Mr. Fu.

414
00:26:49,960 --> 00:26:50,960
Done for the day?

415
00:26:51,360 --> 00:26:52,360
Hello, Mr. Fu.

416
00:27:22,400 --> 00:27:23,400
Goodbye, Mr. Fu.

417
00:27:24,120 --> 00:27:25,120
Goodbye, Mr. Fu.

418
00:27:31,360 --> 00:27:32,360
Are you feeling unwell?

419
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:34,480
No.

420
00:27:52,280 --> 00:27:53,280
What's wrong?
Well...

421
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:56,000
Boyfriend,

422
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:57,880
I have an emergency, so I have to go.

423
00:27:58,320 --> 00:27:59,400
Don't... Don't follow me.

424
00:27:59,720 --> 00:28:00,720
You go home first.

425
00:28:17,760 --> 00:28:18,840
This is a nightmare.

426
00:28:19,280 --> 00:28:21,480
I almost pooped my pants.

427
00:28:26,560 --> 00:28:27,680
When did you get here?

428
00:28:28,400 --> 00:28:29,760
Next time you have a stomachache,

429
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:31,000
you can just tell me.

430
00:28:31,080 --> 00:28:32,120
I'm your boyfriend.

431
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:33,880
You don't have to be such a stranger.

432
00:28:42,560 --> 00:28:43,560
Are your legs numb?

433
00:28:44,680 --> 00:28:47,440
Do you need help?

434
00:28:49,320 --> 00:28:50,320
I really do.

435
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:52,480
I've been waiting for a long time too.

436
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:00,160
Not bad today.

437
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:02,200
Isn't that Mr. Fu's car?

438
00:29:03,360 --> 00:29:04,360
Is it?

439
00:29:04,480 --> 00:29:05,480
I think so.

440
00:29:05,720 --> 00:29:06,920
The license plate number is...

441
00:29:08,600 --> 00:29:09,600
Look! Quick, look!
Who is that?

442
00:29:11,880 --> 00:29:13,560
Isn't that our Ruan Ruan?

443
00:29:13,680 --> 00:29:14,680
So cool.

444
00:29:14,840 --> 00:29:16,039
- Morning, Ms. Jiang. - Morning.

445
00:29:16,040 --> 00:29:17,160
Why are those two together?

446
00:29:18,280 --> 00:29:19,280
Ruan Ruan.

447
00:29:36,520 --> 00:29:39,400
I just saw Ruan Si Xian get out of Mr. Fu's car.

448
00:29:39,600 --> 00:29:40,840
Mr. Fu dropped her off himself.

449
00:29:51,880 --> 00:29:52,959
I heard that a few days ago,

450
00:29:52,960 --> 00:29:54,919
when Chairman Fu's wife visited, she accompanied her the whole time.

451
00:29:54,920 --> 00:29:56,440
- Really? - Really.

452
00:29:56,640 --> 00:29:58,199
Chairman Fu's wife was very happy.

453
00:29:58,200 --> 00:29:59,200
That's great.

454
00:29:59,520 --> 00:30:00,560
Get ready for the meeting.

455
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:05,440
Hello, everyone.

456
00:30:05,441 --> 00:30:07,120
I'm the purser for this flight,

457
00:30:07,240 --> 00:30:08,240
Jiang Zi Yue.

458
00:30:08,280 --> 00:30:09,800
It's a pleasure to fly with you all.

459
00:30:11,360 --> 00:30:12,360
Check your IDs.

460
00:30:12,920 --> 00:30:14,336
- IDs are in place. - IDs are in place.

461
00:30:14,360 --> 00:30:15,360
Sync your watches.

462
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:21,000
Ding Xiao Qi, tell us the characteristics of this flight.

463
00:30:21,840 --> 00:30:23,719
Today's route is to Shanghai.

464
00:30:23,720 --> 00:30:25,959
Its characteristics are a short flight time...

465
00:30:25,960 --> 00:30:27,240
and mostly elite passengers.

466
00:30:27,480 --> 00:30:28,480
On this flight,

467
00:30:28,481 --> 00:30:30,376
there is a frequent-complainer Platinum Card passenger.

468
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:31,680
Keep it down when you pass by.

469
00:30:31,800 --> 00:30:33,400
Be mindful of your words and actions.

470
00:30:33,720 --> 00:30:36,080
Try to satisfy all reasonable requests from them.

471
00:30:36,720 --> 00:30:37,800
But don't be nervous.

472
00:30:38,120 --> 00:30:40,256
If you encounter any problems, report to me immediately.

473
00:30:40,280 --> 00:30:41,280
- Got it. - Got it.

474
00:30:42,240 --> 00:30:43,320
If you have time to gossip,

475
00:30:43,800 --> 00:30:45,080
why don't you clip your nails?

476
00:30:45,840 --> 00:30:46,840
Let's go.

477
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:48,240
- Let's go. - Let's go.

478
00:30:48,840 --> 00:30:49,880
- Let's go. - Let's go.

479
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:51,240
Go.

480
00:30:51,241 --> 00:30:52,641
How's the simulator training going?

481
00:30:53,160 --> 00:30:54,920
It's okay. I just don't have enough time.

482
00:31:03,720 --> 00:31:06,001
We'll do the pre-flight briefing once we're on the plane.

483
00:31:08,120 --> 00:31:09,640
Allocating rest time reasonably...

484
00:31:10,000 --> 00:31:11,120
is very important for women.

485
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:13,320
Otherwise, your complexion will look bad.

486
00:31:41,800 --> 00:31:43,599
Stop it. What else is there to say?

487
00:31:43,600 --> 00:31:45,320
I'm really sorry, Mr. Chao.

488
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:47,040
Let me explain it to you again.

489
00:31:47,200 --> 00:31:48,999
Our Platinum Card upgrade regulations...

490
00:31:49,000 --> 00:31:50,200
are based on points.

491
00:31:50,320 --> 00:31:51,520
There are two ways.

492
00:31:51,800 --> 00:31:52,879
- The first... - Enough. Stop talking.

493
00:31:52,880 --> 00:31:54,960
No matter how many ways, you didn't upgrade me.

494
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,480
Get your supervisor here.

495
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,720
Xiao Yuan.

496
00:32:00,480 --> 00:32:01,480
Hello, Mr. Chao.

497
00:32:01,481 --> 00:32:04,040
I'm the purser for this flight, Jiang Zi Yue.

498
00:32:04,760 --> 00:32:06,240
- So you're Jiang Zi Yue? - Yes.

499
00:32:06,560 --> 00:32:07,560
I'll remember you.

500
00:32:08,080 --> 00:32:09,080
Look at this. What is it?

501
00:32:10,280 --> 00:32:11,560
You're our Platinum Card member.

502
00:32:11,640 --> 00:32:13,039
After I got on the plane,

503
00:32:13,040 --> 00:32:15,200
I told her that I wanted an upgrade.

504
00:32:15,960 --> 00:32:17,440
She scurried off over there,

505
00:32:18,280 --> 00:32:20,000
then she came back and said no.

506
00:32:20,440 --> 00:32:21,440
Let me ask you this.

507
00:32:21,520 --> 00:32:22,656
Did you know about this or not?

508
00:32:22,680 --> 00:32:25,839
Mr. Chao, let me explain. It's like this.

509
00:32:25,840 --> 00:32:27,760
Since you are our valued Platinum Card member,

510
00:32:28,080 --> 00:32:30,480
you were originally in Economy Class,

511
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:33,359
but we've upgraded you to Super Economy Class.

512
00:32:33,360 --> 00:32:34,919
Where? Where is Super Economy Class?

513
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:36,479
It's where you're sitting right now.

514
00:32:36,480 --> 00:32:38,280
If you want to upgrade to Business Class,

515
00:32:38,680 --> 00:32:40,799
we've already checked the system.

516
00:32:40,800 --> 00:32:42,440
You don't seem to have enough points.

517
00:32:44,840 --> 00:32:45,920
I'm a Platinum Card member,

518
00:32:46,200 --> 00:32:47,440
and I don't have enough points?

519
00:32:47,520 --> 00:32:49,520
This is our airline's policy.

520
00:32:50,440 --> 00:32:52,520
So you moved me from the back to the front,

521
00:32:52,840 --> 00:32:54,440
and I'm supposed to thank you for that?

522
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:55,720
That's not what I meant.

523
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:57,400
Fine. Let me ask you a question.

524
00:32:58,200 --> 00:32:59,960
I'm just asking if you can...

525
00:33:00,520 --> 00:33:02,480
bring flammable and explosive items on the plane.

526
00:33:02,840 --> 00:33:04,120
Mr. Chao, of course not.

527
00:33:04,240 --> 00:33:05,519
We have strict security checks...

528
00:33:05,520 --> 00:33:06,880
before every boarding...

529
00:33:07,120 --> 00:33:08,480
to ensure flight safety.

530
00:33:08,600 --> 00:33:09,960
Then how did she get on the plane?

531
00:33:10,760 --> 00:33:11,760
She's a gas canister.

532
00:33:11,761 --> 00:33:13,440
How did she get on the plane?

533
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:14,680
What if she explodes?

534
00:33:15,040 --> 00:33:16,120
What if she blows up on me?

535
00:33:16,960 --> 00:33:18,080
She has quite a temper.

536
00:33:18,320 --> 00:33:19,560
Explode. Go on, explode for me!

537
00:33:19,640 --> 00:33:21,480
No, she was just trying to explain.

538
00:33:21,840 --> 00:33:23,279
Mr. Chao, please don't be angry.

539
00:33:23,280 --> 00:33:26,360
Regarding the upgrade service you mentioned just now,

540
00:33:26,520 --> 00:33:27,600
let me explain.

541
00:33:27,840 --> 00:33:30,520
If you need an upgrade next time,

542
00:33:30,720 --> 00:33:32,079
for Platinum Card members,

543
00:33:32,080 --> 00:33:33,600
besides using points,

544
00:33:33,880 --> 00:33:35,320
we also accept credit card payment.

545
00:33:35,520 --> 00:33:36,960
For example, on this flight today,

546
00:33:37,280 --> 00:33:38,319
if you need an upgrade,

547
00:33:38,320 --> 00:33:39,919
you can pay an extra 500 yuan.

548
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:40,920
That's all it takes.

549
00:33:41,560 --> 00:33:42,800
I have to pay another 500 yuan?

550
00:33:43,440 --> 00:33:44,920
Then why didn't you say so earlier?

551
00:33:45,080 --> 00:33:46,400
It's only 500 yuan!

552
00:33:46,600 --> 00:33:47,600
I'll just swipe my card!

553
00:33:47,601 --> 00:33:48,839
What I want is service!

554
00:33:48,840 --> 00:33:50,640
Do I look like I'm short of 500 yuan?

555
00:33:50,800 --> 00:33:52,719
- I'm a businessman. - Right.

556
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:53,839
Look at me. Look at what I'm wearing.

557
00:33:53,840 --> 00:33:55,759
This is a Jaeger-LeCoultre. This is Hermes.

558
00:33:55,760 --> 00:33:57,400
I'm a business professional.

559
00:33:57,600 --> 00:34:00,839
Once, I went to the capital of France, Berlin.

560
00:34:00,840 --> 00:34:02,200
As soon as I boarded,

561
00:34:02,560 --> 00:34:04,280
the purser saw me and asked,

562
00:34:04,520 --> 00:34:05,600
"May I help you, sir?"

563
00:34:06,000 --> 00:34:07,000
I said, "Yes."

564
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:08,359
I said I'm a Platinum Card member.

565
00:34:08,360 --> 00:34:09,360
I want an upgrade.

566
00:34:09,480 --> 00:34:10,960
"Okay, no problem."

567
00:34:11,200 --> 00:34:12,640
She knelt down right then and there.

568
00:34:12,800 --> 00:34:13,800
That's kneeling service!

569
00:34:13,960 --> 00:34:14,960
Great food and drinks.

570
00:34:14,961 --> 00:34:16,161
It was all done in 10 minutes.

571
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:17,680
The other day, I went to Chengdu.

572
00:34:17,960 --> 00:34:20,560
I went to Chengdu, and their...

573
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:22,919
Their flight attendant was even prettier.

574
00:34:22,920 --> 00:34:24,480
Their purser saw me.

575
00:34:24,840 --> 00:34:26,120
Our eyes met.

576
00:34:26,400 --> 00:34:27,999
Just as I was thinking about it,

577
00:34:28,000 --> 00:34:29,480
she stepped forward and said,

578
00:34:29,600 --> 00:34:30,920
"Would you like an upgrade, sir?"

579
00:34:31,240 --> 00:34:32,840
Exactly! We were on the same wavelength.

580
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:34,240
She got it done in five minutes.

581
00:34:34,280 --> 00:34:36,039
- Business class! - Yes.

582
00:34:36,040 --> 00:34:37,199
So why is it that with you,

583
00:34:37,200 --> 00:34:38,679
you're acting like you're so important?

584
00:34:38,680 --> 00:34:39,680
Mr. Chao, it's like this.

585
00:34:39,681 --> 00:34:41,160
I apologize to you once again.

586
00:34:41,400 --> 00:34:43,719
I hope you can give us a chance to make it up to you.

587
00:34:43,720 --> 00:34:44,999
Regarding what you just said,

588
00:34:45,000 --> 00:34:46,479
we will definitely make serious improvements.

589
00:34:46,480 --> 00:34:48,880
I spend millions of yuan on Hengshi...

590
00:34:49,120 --> 00:34:50,160
every single year.

591
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:51,879
I even know your manager.

592
00:34:51,880 --> 00:34:53,399
What's his name? Wang Le Kang?

593
00:34:53,400 --> 00:34:54,400
Or Wang Kang Le?

594
00:34:54,480 --> 00:34:55,759
He's like a little brother to me!

595
00:34:55,760 --> 00:34:57,639
He hands me his business card while bowing and scraping.

596
00:34:57,640 --> 00:34:59,759
- Yes. - Look at other flight attendants.

597
00:34:59,760 --> 00:35:00,760
They're so pretty.

598
00:35:01,240 --> 00:35:03,479
Look at their short skirts...

599
00:35:03,480 --> 00:35:04,480
and those stockings.
They're all covered in perfume.

600
00:35:05,481 --> 00:35:06,759
But you all smell like sweat.

601
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:07,880
And you're wearing pants.

602
00:35:08,080 --> 00:35:09,160
Your legs look like hams.

603
00:35:09,280 --> 00:35:10,280
And you.

604
00:35:10,281 --> 00:35:11,401
I can see right through you.

605
00:35:11,720 --> 00:35:12,720
You have a black heart,

606
00:35:13,120 --> 00:35:14,136
and your skin is just as dark.

607
00:35:14,160 --> 00:35:15,960
Your face reflects your ugly soul.

608
00:35:16,160 --> 00:35:17,560
And this Michelin figure over here.

609
00:35:17,680 --> 00:35:20,039
How can a Michelin figure like you serve a Platinum Card member?

610
00:35:20,040 --> 00:35:22,519
What are you people? A bunch of dimwits and eyesores.

611
00:35:22,520 --> 00:35:23,520
You look like monsters.

612
00:35:24,360 --> 00:35:26,080
I've talked until my mouth is bone dry.

613
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:28,520
Attendant! Go get me a glass of water.

614
00:35:28,800 --> 00:35:29,839
Certainly, Mr. Chao.

615
00:35:29,840 --> 00:35:30,879
Stop! Don't go.

616
00:35:30,880 --> 00:35:31,919
Go!

617
00:35:31,920 --> 00:35:33,000
You must go!

618
00:35:34,920 --> 00:35:36,256
What's your problem, you lowly attendant?

619
00:35:36,280 --> 00:35:37,560
Go get the water! Go!

620
00:35:38,160 --> 00:35:39,279
- Go get it! Now - Let's go.

621
00:35:39,280 --> 00:35:40,896
You're just a plate-carrier. What do you think you're doing?

622
00:35:40,920 --> 00:35:42,119
Pour it! You have to go.

623
00:35:42,120 --> 00:35:43,320
What are you shouting for?

624
00:35:44,120 --> 00:35:46,320
I have never seen someone as classless as you.

625
00:35:46,440 --> 00:35:48,240
I'm telling you, I've had enough of you.

626
00:35:48,400 --> 00:35:50,080
Do you even deserve our service?

627
00:35:50,160 --> 00:35:51,839
If you want to be in Business Class, pay for it yourself.

628
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:53,256
Why are you bullying our flight attendants?

629
00:35:53,280 --> 00:35:55,079
Do you really think that just because you have a platinum card,

630
00:35:55,080 --> 00:35:56,719
the whole world revolves around you?

631
00:35:56,720 --> 00:35:57,720
Who do you think you are?

632
00:35:57,760 --> 00:35:58,760
Go on, keep talking.

633
00:35:58,761 --> 00:36:00,119
- I'm recording everything. - Go ahead, record it.

634
00:36:00,120 --> 00:36:01,440
- Come on, say it! - Forget it.

635
00:36:01,880 --> 00:36:03,079
What did you just call us?

636
00:36:03,080 --> 00:36:05,960
Didn't your mother ever teach you to respect women?

637
00:36:06,040 --> 00:36:08,479
Calling us "lowly plate-carriers" and "lowly attendants".

638
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:09,839
- That's right. - Let me tell you something!

639
00:36:09,840 --> 00:36:10,879
If an emergency ever happens,

640
00:36:10,880 --> 00:36:12,679
you'll be relying on us to save your life.

641
00:36:12,680 --> 00:36:14,239
You board the plane and complain about everything,

642
00:36:14,240 --> 00:36:16,439
but we didn't complain about serving someone as classless as you.

643
00:36:16,440 --> 00:36:17,680
And now you're judging us?

644
00:36:18,040 --> 00:36:19,880
The more I look at you, the more you annoy me!

645
00:36:20,280 --> 00:36:22,119
You have words written on your face.

646
00:36:22,120 --> 00:36:23,120
"Asking for it."

647
00:36:23,200 --> 00:36:24,200
Crass.

648
00:36:24,640 --> 00:36:26,399
- Hey, who are you talking about? - I'm talking about you!

649
00:36:26,400 --> 00:36:28,319
- Who are you talking about? - You! So what?

650
00:36:28,320 --> 00:36:29,439
- I'm talking about you! - What are you trying to do?

651
00:36:29,440 --> 00:36:31,480
- Who are you touching? - Who do you think you are?

652
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:36,400
Go ahead and complain!

653
00:36:36,480 --> 00:36:38,839
- I've wanted to quit ages ago! - Call the police!

654
00:36:38,840 --> 00:36:39,840
Don't move!
Quick, call security!

655
00:36:43,320 --> 00:36:44,320
I have to say,

656
00:36:44,560 --> 00:36:46,040
when you get fired up,

657
00:36:46,760 --> 00:36:47,760
you're really something.

658
00:36:48,320 --> 00:36:49,519
He's a grown man,

659
00:36:49,520 --> 00:36:50,936
and the security officer was right there.

660
00:36:50,960 --> 00:36:52,480
Why did you charge at him like that?

661
00:36:55,800 --> 00:36:56,800
Ouch.

662
00:36:57,120 --> 00:36:59,200
If it hurts, why did you charge in?

663
00:37:00,520 --> 00:37:01,520
All right.

664
00:37:03,920 --> 00:37:04,920
Wait a second.

665
00:37:05,240 --> 00:37:06,600
Let me take a photo as evidence.

666
00:37:08,240 --> 00:37:09,240
Lift it up a bit.

667
00:37:14,280 --> 00:37:15,359
If Fu Ming Yu sees this,

668
00:37:15,360 --> 00:37:16,360
he'll be heartbroken.

669
00:37:17,120 --> 00:37:18,360
Don't you dare send it.

670
00:37:18,960 --> 00:37:20,080
I don't want anyone to know.

671
00:37:20,560 --> 00:37:21,560
I know.

672
00:37:24,040 --> 00:37:25,240
How's Xiao Zhen doing lately?

673
00:37:26,720 --> 00:37:28,080
The same as always.

674
00:37:28,160 --> 00:37:30,039
That's why they say, when you're young,

675
00:37:30,040 --> 00:37:31,240
don't meet anyone too amazing.

676
00:37:39,880 --> 00:37:43,000
Xuan, have you ever met anyone amazing?

677
00:37:44,040 --> 00:37:45,040
Me?

678
00:37:46,160 --> 00:37:47,440
I've met plenty of people.

679
00:37:47,640 --> 00:37:48,640
Amazing?

680
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:51,840
No.

681
00:37:52,680 --> 00:37:55,039
Did you meet someone amazing before...

682
00:37:55,040 --> 00:37:56,320
who let you down?

683
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:58,960
Is that why you don't trust men anymore?

684
00:37:59,400 --> 00:38:00,680
It's not that I don't trust men.

685
00:38:01,120 --> 00:38:03,279
I believe there's no such thing as "most amazing".

686
00:38:03,280 --> 00:38:05,200
The next one will be even better.

687
00:38:05,720 --> 00:38:06,840
Aren't your exams coming up?

688
00:38:07,360 --> 00:38:08,399
For the time being,

689
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:10,080
you don't need to help out at the bar.

690
00:38:10,440 --> 00:38:11,440
Go home.

691
00:38:11,840 --> 00:38:13,679
- Get some rest. - Wait, I didn't get my suitcase.

692
00:38:13,680 --> 00:38:14,840
Your suitcase.

693
00:38:19,320 --> 00:38:20,800
Go home now. Get some good rest.

694
00:38:21,120 --> 00:38:22,400
Don't be so impulsive next time.

695
00:38:22,600 --> 00:38:23,600
Take it easy.

696
00:38:49,360 --> 00:38:50,360
(Hengshi Air Simulator Training Center)

697
00:38:50,361 --> 00:38:55,360
(F1 Exam Venue)

698
00:39:23,120 --> 00:39:25,000
Xiao Ruan, good afternoon.

699
00:39:25,560 --> 00:39:27,240
Where did you get the sweet and sour ribs?

700
00:39:27,320 --> 00:39:28,320
It looks delicious.

701
00:39:28,360 --> 00:39:29,800
I'll go get some from the counter.

702
00:40:07,680 --> 00:40:11,040
(She's Mine)

703
00:40:26,120 --> 00:40:27,120
Ms. Ruan.

704
00:40:27,560 --> 00:40:28,560
The thing is...

705
00:40:29,560 --> 00:40:30,560
there's something.

706
00:40:31,080 --> 00:40:32,080
Just say it.

707
00:40:35,400 --> 00:40:36,760
How's your meal going?

708
00:40:37,400 --> 00:40:39,000
Why don't we talk outside?

709
00:40:39,360 --> 00:40:41,360
I haven't even touched my food yet. Can't you see?

710
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:42,840
Let's talk after we eat.

711
00:40:43,160 --> 00:40:44,160
Okay.

712
00:40:54,640 --> 00:40:55,640
Ms. Ruan,

713
00:40:55,840 --> 00:40:57,200
I'll just tell you here.

714
00:41:00,840 --> 00:41:01,840
It's that...

715
00:41:02,200 --> 00:41:04,280
my mentor was reported by a Platinum Card passenger.

716
00:41:04,720 --> 00:41:05,720
You should know about it.

717
00:41:05,960 --> 00:41:07,240
He was on your flight.

718
00:41:09,160 --> 00:41:11,520
- And? - You know how the passenger was.

719
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:12,800
You saw his behavior.

720
00:41:12,801 --> 00:41:14,360
He demanded that my mentor be fired.

721
00:41:16,880 --> 00:41:18,040
I'll give you one minute.

722
00:41:18,800 --> 00:41:20,559
If you don't finish by then, I'll go home.

723
00:41:20,560 --> 00:41:22,799
Actually, this matter isn't that big of a deal.

724
00:41:22,800 --> 00:41:24,320
When this happened in the past,

725
00:41:24,520 --> 00:41:26,680
the person would just be grounded for a while at most.

726
00:41:26,760 --> 00:41:28,120
But my mentor was fired.

727
00:41:28,320 --> 00:41:30,200
I think it might have been Mr. Fu's decision.

728
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:32,240
But isn't it a bit too severe?

729
00:41:32,920 --> 00:41:34,719
I know this is a difficult request,

730
00:41:34,720 --> 00:41:36,439
but could you talk to Mr. Fu?

731
00:41:36,440 --> 00:41:37,640
Ask him not to fire her.

732
00:41:38,160 --> 00:41:39,200
Could he show some mercy?

733
00:41:40,320 --> 00:41:41,320
Fu Ming...

734
00:41:44,680 --> 00:41:46,120
My relationship with Mr. Fu...

735
00:41:46,360 --> 00:41:47,920
isn't what you think it is.

736
00:41:48,680 --> 00:41:50,480
I'm in no position to influence this matter.

737
00:41:50,800 --> 00:41:52,120
- So... - Is there anything else?

738
00:41:55,720 --> 00:41:56,720
I'm sorry.

739
00:41:57,520 --> 00:41:58,536
I shouldn't have told you this.

740
00:41:58,560 --> 00:42:00,040
Just pretend I never came to see you.

741
00:42:21,280 --> 00:42:22,680
Should I give you an access card?

742
00:42:22,960 --> 00:42:24,456
It'll be easier for you to come and go.

743
00:42:24,480 --> 00:42:25,480
No.

744
00:42:26,400 --> 00:42:27,416
That wouldn't be appropriate.

745
00:42:27,440 --> 00:42:29,721
Then before you come over, you can just send me a text...

746
00:42:29,960 --> 00:42:30,960
or give me a call.

747
00:42:33,760 --> 00:42:34,760
Ruan Si Xian,

748
00:42:35,480 --> 00:42:37,480
don't tell me you're too shy to text me.

749
00:42:38,920 --> 00:42:39,920
I...

750
00:42:40,720 --> 00:42:41,720
I just...

751
00:42:41,960 --> 00:42:43,480
didn't know how to tell you.

752
00:42:44,040 --> 00:42:45,040
I'm your boyfriend.

753
00:42:45,520 --> 00:42:46,976
Of course you can tell me whatever is on your mind.

754
00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:48,080
It's not a personal matter.

755
00:42:48,400 --> 00:42:49,400
It's business.

756
00:42:50,560 --> 00:42:51,560
Business?

757
00:42:53,880 --> 00:42:55,440
Isn't it even simpler to talk business?

758
00:42:56,280 --> 00:42:57,280
Just be direct.

759
00:42:58,720 --> 00:42:59,720
It's just...

760
00:43:00,360 --> 00:43:01,536
It's about a flight attendant.

761
00:43:01,560 --> 00:43:02,560
Her name is Jiang Zi Yue.

762
00:43:02,640 --> 00:43:03,640
Do you remember her?

763
00:43:03,880 --> 00:43:04,880
Which one?

764
00:43:05,320 --> 00:43:07,080
There are many flight attendants at Hengshi.

765
00:43:07,400 --> 00:43:10,120
The one whom a Platinum Card member complained about a few days ago.

766
00:43:11,720 --> 00:43:12,720
She was fired.

767
00:43:13,600 --> 00:43:14,960
- Yes. - Why?

768
00:43:15,280 --> 00:43:16,400
The passenger demanded it.

769
00:43:17,360 --> 00:43:18,360
So you just fired her?

770
00:43:20,560 --> 00:43:22,280
Ruan Si Xian, you didn't come here...

771
00:43:23,200 --> 00:43:24,240
to plead for her, did you?

772
00:43:29,240 --> 00:43:30,600
You used to be a flight attendant.

773
00:43:32,560 --> 00:43:33,680
You should know very well...

774
00:43:33,760 --> 00:43:34,816
what the consequences are...

775
00:43:34,840 --> 00:43:36,040
when a VIP files a complaint.

776
00:43:36,760 --> 00:43:37,760
Are you asking me...

777
00:43:38,000 --> 00:43:39,080
to set a precedent for you?

778
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:46,040
(Departing Ep. 14 for Ep. 15)
